    "backstory": "Once a respected bartender at the 'Last Sip,' Dewey got caught slipping DRIP to the wrong flock. Now a wanted ghost, he haunts the city's underbelly, always one step ahead of the enforcers, seeking revenge and desperately trying to find a cure for the parasite burrowing in his eyes.",
